sc-24140 — feature-end review round 1 (decode routing): mutation runs
======================================================================

Each mutation was applied alone to the committed fix, the named tests were run, and the file was
restored (and touched) before the next. CPU rows: `cargo test --locked --no-fail-fast -p
candle-llm` in Git Bash (CPU target). CUDA row: the same with `--features cuda` under MSVC 14.44
vcvars, `CUDA_COMPUTE_CAP=120`, GPU 0 (RTX Pro 6000 / sm_120). All rows were RED under the
mutation and GREEN on the restored tree.

